<title>FRANCE: BASKETBALL-PAU'S TOP PLAYER OUT FOR ONE MONTH.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-PAU'S TOP PLAYER OUT FOR ONE MONTH.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antoine Rigaudeau, top playmaker for Pau-Orthez and the French national team, will be out for a month with an elbow injury.</p>
<p>Rigaudeau, injured during a French championship match on Saturday, will miss Pau's EuroLeague group D games away to Efes Pilsen of Turkey and Kinder Bologna of Italy early next month.</p>
<p>He will also be unavailable for France's European championship qualifiers against Belgium and Switzerland.</p>
</text>
